-- ### **Hard Difficulty (Aim for 4–5 minutes each)**

-- **7. Period-over-Period Analysis (Window Functions)**

-- > Analyze the growth of global participation in the Winter games. For every Winter edition, return the year, the total number of participating countries, and the percentage change in participating countries compared to the *strictly chronological previous* Winter edition. Round this percentage change to two decimal places. (The very first Winter edition will naturally have a null or blank percentage change).


select 
    edition_year
    ,total_countries
    ,lag(total_countries,1) over (order by edition_year asc) as prev_total_countries 
    ,(total_countries-lag(total_countries,1) over (order by edition_year asc))/lag(total_countries,1) over (order by edition_year asc)*100 as perc_change
from editions
where season = 'Winter'




